      "correct_certainty_level": "medium",
      "evidence_text": "对话中表明仅为倾向性诊断的原文",
      "reasoning": "判定理由"
    }
  ],
  "summary": {
    "total_checked": N,
    "errors_found": N
  }
}

## 注意事项
- 如果没有发现确定性错误，certainty_errors为空数组，summary中errors_found为0
